oris  Johnson  says he will try to bring this fractured  country together he got the country's  votes but he'll now have to earn its  trust Boris Johnson now has a lot of  political capital to spend and with the  opposition in disarray here he now has a  lot of time on his side as well  Michele Mark Phillips in London thank  you
 

